    "Agents post here with hiboss progress post \"…\" — no push, no inbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体用 hiboss progress post \"…\" 发到这里——不推送，不进收件箱。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントは hiboss progress post \"…\" でここに投稿します。プッシュ通知も受信箱への追加もありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "에이전트는 hiboss progress post \"…\"로 여기에 게시해요. 푸시 알림도 없고 받은 편지함에도 들어가지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เอเจนต์โพสต์ที่นี่ด้วย hiboss progress post \"…\" — ไม่มีการพุช ไม่เข้ากล่องขาเข้า"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los agentes publican aquí con hiboss progress post \"…\": sin notificaciones ni bandeja de entrada."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एजेंट hiboss progress post \"…\" से यहाँ पोस्ट करते हैं — न पुश, न इनबॉक्स।"
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ينشر الوكلاء هنا باستخدام hiboss progress post \"…\" — بلا إشعارات ولا صندوق وارد."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os agentes publicam aqui com hiboss progress post \"…\" — sem push, sem caixa de entrada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
